flowchart TB
    U[Pharmacy attendant] --> GUI[GUI / tkinter screens]
    GUI --> APP[ApplicationServices facade]
    APP --> SVC[Application services]
    SVC --> DOM[Domain model]
    SVC --> REPO[Repositories]
    REPO --> DBM[Database manager]
    DBM --> SQL[(SQLite database)]

    subgraph L1["Layer 1 — GUI"]
      GUI
    end
    subgraph L2["Layer 2 — Application"]
      APP
      SVC
    end
    subgraph L3["Layer 3 — Domain"]
      DOM
    end
    subgraph L4["Layer 4 — Persistence"]
      REPO
      DBM
      SQL
    end

    SQL -. "results / records" .-> DBM
    DBM -. "mapped data / errors" .-> REPO
    REPO -. "results / errors" .-> SVC
    SVC -. "result / expected exception" .-> GUI
    GUI -. "message / refreshed view" .-> U
